<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-July C/A deficit 563.1 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-July C/A deficit 563.1 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal had an accumulated current account deficit of 563.1 billion escudos between January and July 1996 after a deficit of 485.0 billion in the same period of 1995, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>(In billion escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>			 Jan-July 96  Jan-July 95  July 96 July 95</p>
<p>    C/A balance     -563.1	  -485.0	-41.5   -38.9</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
